<title>EGYPT: Egypt says seeks 4,000 to 5,000 tonnes vegoils.</title>
<headline>Egypt says seeks 4,000 to 5,000 tonnes vegoils.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's official Holding Company for Food Industries said on Monday it was seeking 4,000 to 5,000 tonnes of crude palm kernel oil or coconut oil for June delivery.</p>
<p>The company said the oils should be of Malaysian or Indonesian origin and that the deadline for bids is at 0900 GMT on May 20.</p>
<p>The firm also said that it has the right to increase the amount it seeks by 50 percent or decrease it by 25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
